ply
format ascii 1.0
comment A single triangle, written by hand to serve as an emissive lamp.
comment
comment The winding is the whole point of this file. The cross product of (v1 - v0) and (v2 - v0)
comment is (0, -14, 0), so the normal points at -Y and the lamp lights whatever is below it with no
comment rotation applied. Reversing any two vertices would aim it at the sky instead, and an
comment emitter facing away is black rather than wrong - there is nothing to see and nothing to
comment debug.
element vertex 3
property float x
property float y
property float z
element face 1
property list uchar uint vertex_indices
end_header
-2.0 0.0 -1.2
2.0 0.0 -1.2
0.0 0.0 2.3
3 0 1 2
